      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling trapped by the weight of your family history, and that feeling of inevitability can be incredibly heavy. While genetics play a role in predispositions, your choices and actions in the present moment are still powerful forces. Therapy can offer tools to manage these ingrained patterns, allowing you to navigate them with more agency, even if the underlying tendencies are present. Recognizing the patterns is the first step toward actively choosing a different path.",
